### Create experiment
POST http://localhost:3001/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "simSteps": 200,
  "simSeed": 42,
  "totalEpisodes": 30,
  "agents": [
    { "type": "mab",       "hyperparams": { "epsilon": 0.3 } },
    { "type": "linucb",    "hyperparams": { "alpha": 0.5 } },
    { "type": "qlearning", "hyperparams": { "alpha": 0.1, "gamma": 0.95, "epsilon": 0.3 } }
  ]
}

### Start experiment
POST http://localhost:3001/api/experiments/5/start

### Get experiment
GET http://localhost:3001/api/experiments/5

### Get episodes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/experiments/runs/1/episodes